{}
White has no first move that forces a capture of any black group.  

After the natural forcing sequence W B2 B B1 the black material A2, B3–B4 and B1–C1–C2 is left with the shared liberties A1, A3, B2 and A4. Any white first move in the neighbourhood – A3, A4, B1 or B2 – is met by Black with an immediate connect / capture that restores at least one liberty to the merged black group, e.g.  

* 1.W B1 2.B B2 puts W B1 in atari at A1 and joins all black stones on liberties A1 A3 A4;  
* 1.W B2 2.B B1 is forced. 3.W A3 4.B A4 captures A3, 3.W A4 4.B B2 5.W A1 is illegal, etc.  

No first move gives White a plan that defeats every Black defence and forces a capture of a black group.

